//
// Description : The handle and call of the FT dialog compiled LATE that other files reach -
//               BrowsePackagesFT.dg (ShowPicker) - declared early, so a file compiled before it
//               can reach it.
//
//               Until 2026-09-29 this package also held DFRefactor's own dark message boxes -
//               RefactorInfoBox / RefactorStopBox / RefactorYesNoBox, shown in MessageBoxFT.dg -
//               and ConfirmDialogFT.dg's ShowConfirm. Those are the RDCFlexTron library's now:
//               FTInfoBox / FTStopBox / FTYesNoBox, with the same arguments and return values,
//               FTHtmlMessage for a formatted body with verb buttons (FTMessageBox.pkg), and
//               FTInputBox for the prompt that asks for a name (FTInputBox.pkg).
